OL,3,GNEWSAPoppy displays 'a fitting tribute'
OL,4,Ato fallen
OL,5,
OL,6,FHandmade poppies cascading from
OL,7,Fchurches and a stunning purple coat for
OL,8,Fa horse sculpture are among
OL,9,Fremembrance-themed displays created by
OL,10,Fvolunteers.
OL,12,FKnitters and crocheters have dressed up
OL,13,Ftowns and villages across East
OL,14,FYorkshire and Lincolnshire in time for
OL,15,FRemembrance Day.
OL,17,FIn Hedon, thousands of poppies have
OL,18,Fbeen attached to a cargo net hung from
OL,19,Fthe town's beacon.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
