OL,3,GNEWSAPoppy displays 'a fitting tribute'
OL,4,Ato fallen
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhil Hinch, president of the town's
OL,7,FBritish Legion branch, said: "It's been
OL,8,Fan amazing experience and community
OL,9,Fproject that has come to fruition. It's
OL,10,Fa fitting tribute to all the people who
OL,11,Flost their lives."
